<section id="setup" class="view hide"><div class="grid"><div class="panel span6"><h2>World & simulation scale</h2><div class="split"><div><label>Election year</label><input type="number" id="settingYear" min="1789" max="2200" step="1"></div><div><label>Simulation start</label><select id="settingStart"><option value="18">18 months before election</option><option value="12">12 months before election</option><option value="6">6 months before election</option><option value="3">3 months before election</option><option value="0">Election month</option></select></div><div><label>Primary election focus (dashboard)</label><select id="settingScope"><option value="presidential">Presidential</option><option value="senate">Senate class cycle (illustrative)</option><option value="house">House (illustrative)</option><option value="state">Single state</option><option value="all">All three federal contests</option></select></div><div><label>Selected state</label><select id="settingState"></select></div><div><label>Time step</label><select id="settingPace"><option value="week">Weekly</option><option value="month">Monthly</option><option value="quarter">Quarterly</option></select></div><div><label>Simulation detail</label><select id="settingDetail"><option value="quick">Quick</option><option value="standard">Standard</option><option value="deep">Deep</option></select></div></div><label><input type="checkbox" id="settingAuto"> Automatically generate campaign events on every turn</label><label><input type="checkbox" id="settingPoll"> Automatically publish periodic polls</label><label><input type="checkbox" id="settingThird"> Include minor-party vote share</label><p class="hint">The presidential simulation remains nationwide; focus selects your preferred context, not a restriction on all calculated races. Other elections use approximations, not historical district data. All races and candidates are fictional.</p></div><div class="panel span6"><h2>Political environment</h2><label>Year archetype</label><select id="settingPreset"><option value="neutral">Neutral / ordinary year</option><option value="mildD">Mild Democratic year</option><option value="mildR">Mild Republican year</option><option value="waveD">Democratic wave</option><option value="waveR">Republican wave</option><option value="anti">Anti-incumbent year</option><option value="chaos">Highly volatile year</option><option value="custom">Custom</option></select><div id="environmentSliders"></div><label>Dominant national issue</label><select id="settingIssue"><option value="balanced">Balanced</option><option value="economy">Economy / cost of living</option><option value="healthcare">Healthcare</option><option value="immigration">Immigration</option><option value="housing">Housing</option><option value="climate">Climate / environment</option><option value="security">National security</option><option value="education">Education</option></select><label>Event frequency</label><input id="settingFrequency" type="range" min="0" max="100"><div class="flex between small muted"><span>Quiet</span><span id="frequencyValue">—</span><span>Chaotic</span></div><div class="flex" style="margin-top:16px"><button class="primary" onclick="applySettings()">Apply settings</button><button onclick="newUniverse()" class="danger">New universe</button></div><div class="notice small" style="margin-top:12px">Changing the election year or start date resets the campaign calendar. Other settings update the existing universe without erasing its history.</div></div></div></section>
<section id="candidates" class="view hide"><div class="grid"><div class="panel span4"><h2>Candidate roster</h2><div id="candidateList"></div><hr class="hr"><button onclick="generateCandidate('d')">Randomize Democrat</button> <button onclick="generateCandidate('r')">Randomize Republican</button><p class="hint">Candidate traits persist between turns and are independent of political party.</p></div><div class="panel span8"><div class="flex between"><h2>Candidate editor</h2><select id="editSide" style="width:180px" onchange="renderCandidates()"><option value="d">Democrat</option><option value="r">Republican</option></select></div><div class="split"><div><label>Full name</label><input id="candName" oninput="editCandidate('name',this.value)"></div><div><label>Age</label><input id="candAge" type="number" min="25" max="100" oninput="editCandidate('age',+this.value)"></div><div><label>Career background</label><select id="candCareer" onchange="editCandidate('career',this.value)"><option>Governor</option><option>Senator</option><option>Representative</option><option>Mayor</option><option>State legislator</option><option>Business executive</option><option>Activist</option><option>Military veteran</option><option>Attorney</option><option>Political outsider</option></select></div><div><label>Coalition style</label><select id="candCoalition" onchange="editCandidate('coalition',this.value)"><option value="broad">Broad-tent</option><option value="base">Base mobilization</option><option value="working">Working-class populist</option><option value="suburban">Suburban professional</option><option value="rural">Rural / small-town</option><option value="urban">Urban progressive</option><option value="cross">Cross-partisan</option><option value="youth">Youth-driven</option></select></div><div><label>Candidate archetype</label><select id="candArchetype" onchange="applyArchetype(this.value)"><option value="custom">Custom</option><option value="average">Ordinary politician</option><option value="charismatic">Charismatic campaigner</option><option value="technocrat">Disciplined technocrat</option><option value="firebrand">Aggressive firebrand</option><option value="veteran">Experienced veteran</option><option value="outsider">Unpredictable outsider</option></select></div><div><label>Home state</label><select id="candHome" onchange="editCandidate('home',this.value)"></select></div></div><hr class="hr"><h3>Attributes · 0–100</h3><p class="hint">50 = ordinary professional. High gaffe proneness, aggressiveness and risk tolerance are not inherently positive.</p><div id="candidateSliders" class="split"></div><div id="candidateAnalysis" class="notice small" style="margin-top:14px"></div></div></div></section>
